{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"代数闭包"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"代数闭包"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"域","text":"域"}},{"Plain":" $F$ 的代数闭包是满足如下条件的域扩张 $F\\hookrightarrow\\overline{F}$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$F \\hookrightarrow \\overline{F}$ 为代数扩张;</li>\n<li>$\\overline{F}$ 为代数闭域.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>代数闭包在同构意义下唯一, 但可能有非平凡自同构.</p>\n"}]}}